{"text": " Did you know that if you mix ripe bananas and a sweet potato in a bowl, then add peanut butter, two eggs, baking powder, a handful of walnuts, and some dark chocolate to give it that rich flavor. Mix everything together, pour it into a loaf pan, just like this. Add a few extra walnuts, then bake it for around 55 minutes. You end up with a soft, rich, sweet potato banana bread that's actually good for your gut. And because all the sweetness comes from the bananas and the sweet potato, there's no refined sugar and no crash afterwards. If you enjoyed this recipe, comment what state you're from so I know you watched all the way through. And don't forget to follow me for more content like this.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.68, "text": " Did you know that if you mix ripe bananas", "tokens": [50364, 2589, 291, 458, 300, 498, 291, 2890, 31421, 22742, 50498], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09748916761249515, "compression_ratio": 1.681967213114754, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038643893785774708}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.68, "end": 4.5600000000000005, "text": " and a sweet potato in a bowl,", "tokens": [50498, 293, 257, 3844, 7445, 294, 257, 6571, 11, 50592], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09748916761249515, "compression_ratio": 1.681967213114754, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038643893785774708}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 4.5600000000000005, "end": 7.32, "text": " then add peanut butter, two eggs, baking powder,", "tokens": [50592, 550, 909, 19209, 5517, 11, 732, 6466, 11, 12102, 6341, 11, 50730], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09748916761249515, "compression_ratio": 1.681967213114754, "no_speech_prob": 0.0038643893785774708}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 7.32, "end": 9.96, "text": " a handful of walnuts, and some dark chocolate", "tokens": [50730, 257, 16458, 295, 21346, 29251, 11, 293, 512, 2877, 6215, 50862], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.09748916761249515, "compression_ratio": 1.681967213114754, "no_speech